{"logId": "a0d671a5-18a6-4677-bea1-5eb376e51ce6", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——居家", "block_bbox": [310, 119, 737, 166], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[310.0, 119.0], [737.0, 119.0], [737.0, 166.0], [310.0, 166.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、根据个人喜好布置房间，把家装扮成自己喜欢的样子（色调、物件、植物、居家用品等），增加家的温馨和幸福感", "block_bbox": [335, 229, 1557, 308], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 229.0], [1557.0, 229.0], [1557.0, 308.0], [335.0, 308.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、私家车辆", "block_bbox": [338, 316, 498, 350], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[338.0, 316.0], [498.0, 316.0], [498.0, 350.0], [338.0, 350.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）保持车辆内整洁、无杂乱", "block_bbox": [352, 358, 706, 394], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[352.0, 358.0], [706.0, 358.0], [706.0, 394.0], [352.0, 394.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）定期洗车，保持外观基本干净", "block_bbox": [354, 402, 759, 437], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[354.0, 402.0], [759.0, 402.0], [759.0, 437.0], [354.0, 437.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）每辆车必须配备车载灭火器、警示牌、两把多功能破窗器", "block_bbox": [353, 445, 1074, 481], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[353.0, 445.0], [1074.0, 445.0], [1074.0, 481.0], [353.0, 481.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（4）无“保平安”“一帆风顺”“生肖”等影响安全驾驶的挂坠挂饰", "block_bbox": [353, 487, 1152, 523], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[353.0, 487.0], [1152.0, 487.0], [1152.0, 523.0], [353.0, 523.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（5）摩托车、电动车刹车等无安全故障，必备头盔、反光带或反光背心", "block_bbox": [353, 531, 1176, 567], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[353.0, 531.0], [1176.0, 531.0], [1176.0, 567.0], [353.0, 567.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（6）车辆内部不允许加坐垫套装，可配备质感好的脚垫", "block_bbox": [353, 574, 996, 610], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[353.0, 574.0], [996.0, 574.0], [996.0, 610.0], [353.0, 610.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（7）禁止把机动车借给家庭成员之外的人使用，或借用他人车辆", "block_bbox": [353, 617, 1100, 654], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[353.0, 617.0], [1100.0, 617.0], [1100.0, 654.0], [353.0, 654.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [314, 716, 514, 751], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[314.0, 716.0], [514.0, 716.0], [514.0, 751.0], [314.0, 751.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、居家氛围冷、不温暖", "block_bbox": [338, 774, 631, 809], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[338.0, 774.0], [631.0, 774.0], [631.0, 809.0], [338.0, 809.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、缺乏居家概念，没有对居家生活的标准和追求", "block_bbox": [336, 817, 918, 853], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 817.0], [918.0, 817.0], [918.0, 853.0], [336.0, 853.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、刻意证明身份地位或祈求金钱名利、福禄之类的物品，在乎面子、不讲实用", "block_bbox": [336, 860, 1257, 896], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 860.0], [1257.0, 860.0], [1257.0, 896.0